---
import LayoutPage from '../../layouts/LayoutPage.astro';
---

<LayoutPage title="Foldster's Projects — Services" description="Transparent pricing for creator-experience packages">
  <h1>Services &amp; pricing.</h1>
  <p class="lede"><em>Four tiers. Published pricing. Code shipped is code your client account owns. No DRM, no subscription lock-in.</em></p>

  <aside class="launch-banner">
    <span class="badge mono">Launch pricing</span>
    <p>
      <strong>40&thinsp;% off the published rates for the first 3 paid clients.</strong>
      Real discount, real cap &mdash; once the case studies are shipped, prices ratchet back to the listed rates.
    </p>
  </aside>

  <ul class="entry-list">
    <li id="starter" class="entry-block">
      <div class="entry-content">
        <h3>Stream Setup Starter</h3>
        <p class="entry-meta"><em>Foldster | Service | <span class="price-was">$1,500</span> <strong class="price-now">$900</strong> launch</em></p>
        <p>For creators who need a clean overlay and a basic bot to get going. Quick turn, no frills.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Custom overlay design</li>
          <li>Basic Twitch / YouTube bot (commands, mod tools)</li>
          <li>Brand-matched color + type pass</li>
          <li>2-week delivery</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </li>

    <li id="custom-build" class="entry-block">
      <div class="entry-content">
        <h3>Stream Experience Custom Build</h3>
        <p class="entry-meta"><em>Foldster | Service | <span class="price-was">$3,500</span> <strong class="price-now">$2,100</strong> launch</em></p>
        <p>The full experience. Overlays, interactive features, bot personality, integrations across Twitch / Bluesky / Discord. Most clients land here.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Full custom overlay package</li>
          <li>Interactive features (chat games, vote widgets, etc.)</li>
          <li>Bot with personality / voice</li>
          <li>Twitch + Bluesky + Discord integrations</li>
          <li>4–6 week delivery</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </li>

    <li id="complete-package" class="entry-block">
      <div class="entry-content">
        <h3>Complete Creator Brand Package</h3>
        <p class="entry-meta"><em>Foldster | Service | <span class="price-was">$7,500 – $12,000</span> <strong class="price-now">$4,500 – $7,200</strong> launch</em></p>
        <p>Everything in Stream Experience <strong>plus</strong> physical merch and a brand bible. Vertically integrated — the stream looks like the merch looks like the bot's voice.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Stream Experience build (above)</li>
          <li>3D-printed merch (50-unit run, fulfilled from the Fort Lauderdale workshop)</li>
          <li>Printful clothing line (5–10 designs)</li>
          <li>Brand bible &mdash; codifies your color, type, voice, do/don't so future work stays consistent with what you've built</li>
          <li>8–10 week delivery</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </li>

    <li id="partnership" class="entry-block">
      <div class="entry-content">
        <h3>Ongoing Tooling Partnership</h3>
        <p class="entry-meta"><em>Foldster | Service | <span class="price-was">$500 – $1,000 / month</span> <strong class="price-now">$300 – $600 / month</strong> launch</em></p>
        <p>For creators who want continuous evolution — monthly feature additions, merch drops, brand iteration. Retainer model.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Monthly feature additions</li>
          <li>Bug fixes + maintenance on shipped work</li>
          <li>Quarterly merch drops (for Complete Package clients)</li>
          <li>Cancel anytime</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <a href="/contact/" class="cta" slot="cta">start a project &rarr;</a>
</LayoutPage>

<style>
  .launch-banner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    background: var(--color-vellum);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-deep-tidewater);
    padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1.75rem;
    font-family: "iA Writer Quattro", monospace;
  }
  .launch-banner .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--color-deep-tidewater);
    color: var(--color-vellum);
    padding: 0.25rem 0.55rem;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    border-radius: 4px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
  }
  .launch-banner p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #2c3d42;
  }

  .price-was {
    text-decoration: line-through;
    opacity: 0.55;
    margin-right: 0.4rem;
  }
  .price-now {
    color: var(--color-deep-tidewater);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
</style>
